COFFEE_COFFEELINT has been disabled in MegaLinter for the following reason: CoffeeScript tooling is discontinued, and coffeelint can not honor EXCLUDED_DIRECTORIES (it has no exclusion option and only reads .coffeelintignore from its working directory). The linter will be removed in a future version
GRAPHQL_GRAPHQL_SCHEMA_LINTER has been disabled in MegaLinter for the following reason: graphql-schema-linter is unmaintained (no release or commit since May 2022) and its peer dependency range pins graphql to ^15 or ^16, which blocks the whole GraphQL npm install from moving to graphql v17. Use GRAPHQL_BIOME to lint GraphQL files. The linter will be removed in a future version
